WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.000
The space station, crossing.

00:02.700 --> 00:06.539
This is the next time the space station comes over your place.

00:06.989 --> 00:14.334
When it can be seen, it is a bright, steady light gliding across the sky for a few minutes, with no flashing lights.

00:14.784 --> 00:19.439
That light is the Sun on its solar panels, and there are people inside.
